<% set_meta_tags title: 'Accommodation',
                 description: 'View accommodation options at ArogyaM Wellness Center, Sacred Grove, Chowdepalli. Comfortable stays during your Ayurvedic wellness retreat.' %>

<section class="container py-5 mt-5 mb-md-3 mb-lg-4 mb-xxl-5">
  <h1 class="cardHeading packages text-center">Accommodation</h1>
  <p class="text-center text-muted mb-5">Comfortable, peaceful stays at Sacred Grove during your wellness retreat</p>

  <div class="row g-5 align-items-center mb-5">
    <%# Image grid %>
    <div class="col-12 col-lg-6">
      <div class="acco-gallery">
        <div class="acco-gallery-main">
          <%= image_tag(dev_images('acco1.jpg'), data: { fancybox: 'imageGallery' }, alt: 'ArogyaM guest room - single occupancy', loading: "lazy") %>
        </div>
        <div class="acco-gallery-grid">
          <%= image_tag(dev_images('acco2.jpg'), data: { fancybox: 'imageGallery' }, alt: 'ArogyaM guest room - double occupancy', loading: "lazy") %>
          <%= image_tag(dev_images('acco4.jpg'), data: { fancybox: 'imageGallery' }, alt: 'ArogyaM courtyard and central garden', loading: "lazy") %>
          <%= image_tag(dev_images('acco3.jpg'), data: { fancybox: 'imageGallery' }, alt: 'ArogyaM wellness center exterior', loading: "lazy") %>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <%# Description %>
    <div class="col-12 col-lg-6">
      <div class="acco-description">
        <p>
          ArogyaM has two wings separated by a central courtyard where Dhanwantri,
          the deity of the wellness center, is enshrined under a 40-year-old tamarind tree.
        </p>
        <p>
          The guest rooms are beautifully designed and tastefully furnished for single,
          double, and triple occupancy. The nine rooms in the guest wing are named after
          various herbs such as <em>dhatri</em>, <em>japa</em>, <em>abhaya</em>,
          <em>aparajitha</em>, and so on.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <%# Guidelines %>
  <div class="row justify-content-center">
    <div class="col-12 col-lg-10">
      <div class="card border-0 shadow-sm">
        <div class="card-body p-4 p-md-5">
          <h3 class="acco-guidelines-heading mb-4">Guidelines for Guests</h3>
          <p class="text-muted mb-4">To benefit most from the therapies, it is essential that certain Yamas &amp; Niyamas (Rules &amp; Regulations) are observed by all participants:</p>

          <div class="row g-4">
            <div class="col-12 col-md-6">
              <ul class="acco-guidelines-list">
                <li>The Sacred Grove campus is a non-smoking and non-intoxicant zone. Smoking, drinking, or consuming any intoxicants is strictly prohibited.</li>
                <li>Follow the physician's advised dos and don'ts strictly.</li>
                <li>Respect the peaceful atmosphere by avoiding loud music or disruptive group activities.</li>
                <li>Do not pluck any flowers, fruits, or leaves from the orchards and gardens.</li>
                <li>Vegetarian meals are served, and individual cooking or bringing outside food is not allowed.</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
            <div class="col-12 col-md-6">
              <ul class="acco-guidelines-list">
                <li>Be eco-conscious and use plastics sparingly. If necessary, dispose of plastic waste in designated bins.</li>
                <li>Dress appropriately to be in harmony with the spirit of the place.</li>
                <li>Follow the program schedule and its timings for treatments and activities.</li>
                <li>Keep rooms and surroundings clean at all times. Housekeeping staff clean rooms every other day from 9 AM to 11 AM.</li>
                <li>Dispose of waste in designated bins.</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="mt-4 pt-3 border-top">
            <p class="mb-0 text-muted">
              We welcome your suggestions and feedback. Please email us at
              <a href="mailto:wellnesscenter@satsang-foundation.org" class="fw-medium">wellnesscenter@satsang-foundation.org</a>
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<%= render 'shared/cta_banner' %>
